---
import ProseLayout from '@/layouts/ProseLayout.astro';
---

<ProseLayout
  eyebrow="Newsletter"
  title="Not live yet"
  description="The Runtime Signals newsletter is not live yet."
  canonicalPath="/newsletter"
  traceSeed={23}
>
  <p>
    There's no signup form on this page. The newsletter architecture is decided - a managed provider
    stays authoritative for subscriber state, this site never stores an email address, and no
    webhook endpoint exists until there's a durable store that actually needs one - but the provider
    itself hasn't been verified at the account level yet, and no production email will send until
    DNS authentication and consent handling are confirmed.
  </p>
  <p>
    Check back once that verification is complete, or watch <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a> / <a
      href="/atom.xml">Atom</a
    > in the meantime.
  </p>
</ProseLayout>
